  unitName: Countess Magena (EU)
  unitId: 750144
  unitNumber: 7073
  description: Countess Magena of the Rising Moon has been spotted perched on cliffs
    in her eagle form by farmers around the world. It is rumored that she is the
    last heir of her line, and some even speak of her preparation for vengeance.
    The mad eagle Noblesse is on the hunt.
  summonDesc: ... Ka-Kaw? Hunt. Rabbits. Prey.
  fusionDesc: Higher... Sharper... Revenge.
  evoDesc: What is a Countesse? I don't know. I'm an eagle. Only an eagle searching
    for his prey... Are you my prey?
